2	//
3	// The driver shells out to repo scripts (scripts/build_*.sh), reads fixtures
4	// (tests/fixtures/), and scans the engines dir -- all relative to the repo
5	// root. The root is found from the executable's own location via
6	// /proc/self/exe, so it works regardless of the caller's CWD and for both
7	// layouts: build/andesim during development and a repo-root andesim after
8	// the F14 swap.
